\begin{enumerate}
   \item What is the estimated value of intercept? Please provide the EAP estimate, even if it is approximate.
   \item How can we determine the effect of texts A, B, and C? Please refer to the figure of \verb|conditional_effects| and consider it.
   \item How can we determine the effect of teachers A and B? Please refer to the figure of \verb|conditional_effects| and consider it.
   \item What are the characteristics of interaction? Please refer to the figure of \verb|conditional_effects| and consider it.
\end{enumerate}
